OL,3,GNEWSABreeder who claimed he sold dogs  
OL,4,Ato the Kardashians jailed for cropping 
OL,5,Apuppies' ears                          
OL,7,FA dog breeder who claimed to have sold 
OL,8,Fdogs to celebrities and was followed on
OL,9,Fsocial media by Snoop Dogg has been    
OL,10,Fsentenced to two years in prison for   
OL,11,Fmutilating the ears of bulldog puppies,
OL,12,Fa court has heard.                     
OL,14,FEugene Vatsaloo, 57, from Tonyrefail in
OL,15,FRhondda Cynon Taf, was convicted of 13 
OL,16,Foffences including the illegal         
OL,17,Fprocedure of cropping the ears of      
OL,18,Fpocket bullies to follow a social media
OL,19,Ftrend.                                 
