OL,3,GNEWSABreeder who claimed he sold dogs  
OL,4,Ato the Kardashians jailed for cropping 
OL,5,Apuppies' ears                          
OL,7,FVatsaloo, who claimed to have sold a   
OL,8,Fdog without cropped ears to the        
OL,9,FKardashian family, attracted millions  
OL,10,Fof views on his social media accounts, 
OL,11,Fused to advertise his dogs, with one   
OL,12,Fbulldog selling for as much as #6,000. 
OL,14,FThe judge said his "cruelty was        
OL,15,Fprolonged and purely for financial     
OL,16,Fgain".                                 
